 "headline": "",
 "intro": "IHC COLLABORATED WITH ADULT SWIM FOR ALL FOUR YEARS OF ITS MUSIC AND COMEDY FESTIVAL.",
 "introPieces": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "html": "<p>For the <em>Adult Swim Fest’s</em> 4 year run, IHEARTCOMIX executed multiple social and digital marketing campaigns to promote the event and drive viewership resulting in billions of impressions year over year. Each year featured a variety of creative activations unique for what was happening at the fest, but at the core of our approach was always awareness via all traditional media outlets and IHC networks. </p>"
  },
  {
   "type": "text2",
   "left": "<p><strong>Digital Marketing &amp; Paid Media </strong></p>\n<p>To maximize awareness of the lineup and drive ticket sales to the festival, IHC coordinated media placements through the exchange of tickets and listing the event on all major event calendars. We secured social coverage, exclusive giveaways, newsletter placements, and promotion across relevant forums.</p>",
   "right": "<p><strong>IHC Newsletter &amp; Socials</strong></p>\n<p>Adult Swim trusted us to not only conceptualize and execute engaging promotional tactics, they also tapped us for our community of culture fans and consumers. Our newsletter and social following was an integral aspect of every marketing campaign, promoting both the festival as well as all initiatives each year.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Scavenger Hunt & Sweepstakes",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>In 2019 we partnered with 12 carefully chosen retailers in LA to participate in a county-wide scavenger hunt to increase visibility in the local market. Daily clues were posted on Instagram for fans to decipher the day’s location of the winning ticket.</p>",
     "right": "<p>In both 2019 and 2020, we also produced weekly sweepstakes with exclusive prizes to further bolster ticket sales. These campaigns engaged audiences nationwide with escalating rewards each week.</p>"
    },
