  {
   "title": "2020 & 2021 Virtual Festival",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Given the COVID-restrictions that forced the festival online, we created concepts that leaned into this unique opportunity to engage a global audience on a limited budget, unrestricted by a festival’s physical location. In addition to our usual promotions, we also expanded support in the followng ways:</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p><strong>Douggpound Promo Videos:</strong> We collaborated with Tim &amp; Eric collaborator DJ Douggpound to produce a series of promotional videos in the classic Adult Swim tone to exited audiences for the festival.</p>",
     "right": "<p><strong>Chat Moderation:</strong> IHC also jumped on to manage and moderate the livestream chat on Youtube, overseeing a team of 12 people to orchestrate conversations around talent appearances, community guidelines, and execute key messaging.</p>"
    },
